    "detailed_description": "My Dirty Horror is a game developed together with a streamer community.<br>In this game you and/or your team are investigators who investigate places full of paranormal activity and rid them of any malevolence. Collect clues about activities and carry out rituals to cleanse the area. With your equipment you'll look for clues for the supernatural beings that are up to mischief in the place and record them to collect your reward.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Realistic experience:</strong> We have developed the game so that the textures look as realistic as possible.<br></li><li><strong>Multiplayer:</strong> In a multiplayer game, up to six players can join.<br></li><li><strong>Regular events:</strong> Since this game is community based, there will be regular multiplayer events. </li></ul>",
